# Scene2-2-8

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐2‐8
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:30_2
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『シャワールーム』を選択
; ========================================

; 写真撮影の音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:走进淋浴房，<br>只见可可正在用手机拍下室内的情况。|#0202Adv08_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:你在拍什么呢？|#0202Adv08_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:呀啊啊啊！？|#0202Adv08_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:什么嘛，是你啊希罗亲。<br>你能不能别突然搭话啊？|#0202Adv08_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她刚才大概是沉迷于拍照，<br>被我突然问话吓了一跳。|#0202Adv08_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:但她的脸上<br>转眼间就写满了兴奋。|#0202Adv08_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCamera Offset:-6.7,-1.8 Zoom:0.5 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:刚才我发现了这个涂鸦，<br>你看，是不是很厉害？|#0202Adv08_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……这个多半是诺亚干的好事。<br>真是的，到处乱涂乱画……<br>必须得把它擦掉。|#0202Adv08_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不不不，不准擦。<br>这个搞不好超有价值的呢。|#0202Adv08_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……价值是指？|#0202Adv08_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你不知道吗？<br>那个世界闻名的艺术家【气球】。<br>说不定就是诺亚哦！|#0202Adv08_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我不太了解这方面的事，但对这个名字略有耳闻。|#0202Adv08_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:据说是个搞街头涂鸦的神秘艺术家，<br>似乎还挺有名的……|#0202Adv08_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚的画的确有着非同寻常的魅力。<br>就算她真是个名人也不奇怪。|#0202Adv08_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对吧。我先把这个涂鸦拍下来，<br>之后搞不好会爆火呢。|#0202Adv08_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 写真撮影の音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:蹭蹭大红人的名气，<br>这样人家也能挤进当红主播的行列了。<br>嘻嘻嘻。|#0202Adv08_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……原来你还打算着回家啊。|#0202Adv08_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哈？那肯定啊。<br>我一定要回家。不管动用什么手段。|#0202Adv08_Coco008| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为【我推】还在等我呢。<br>|#0202Adv08_Coco009| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着她喃喃自语的侧脸，<br>我忽然想到，也许现在正是打探她的好机会。|#0202Adv08_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.2
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Coco

[PrintTextModified Text:……想问你一个问题。|#0202Adv08_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:关于前几天的直播。<br>除了那个地下设施以外，<br>你还知道什么别的信息吗？|#0202Adv08_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你手里到底还掌握了什么？|#0202Adv08_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我直截了当地问道，<br>而可可听了明显有些不高兴。|#0202Adv08_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……笨蛋。我怎么可能告诉你。|#0202Adv08_Coco010| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:要知道，随时随地都有可能有人变成魔女，<br>不知道有谁会突然对我怀有杀意。|#0202Adv08_Coco011| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:所以在这里的所有人！<br>没有一个可信的！|#0202Adv08_Coco012| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我已经不想再死一遍了！|#0202Adv08_Coco013| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:再什么一遍……？|#0202Adv08_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可可似乎是说漏了嘴，脸上的表情一下子僵住。|#0202Adv08_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:没、没啥，口误而已。<br>我说，你能去别的地方待着吗？<br>我要准备直播了。|#0202Adv08_Coco014| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:在这里……直播？|#0202Adv08_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这里隔音很好，可能是因为墙壁厚吧。<br>所以我想试着在这里播一次看看。|#0202Adv08_Coco015| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……可是说不定会有人来淋浴啊。|#0202Adv08_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:这个时间不会有人来啦！<br>而且要是真有人来我就不播了。|#0202Adv08_Coco016| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:行了，别碍事，走开走开！|#0202Adv08_Coco017| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:还是说你想和我一起播？|#0202Adv08_Coco018| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:……不必了。|#0202Adv08_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:（隔音啊……这是个有用的信息）|#0202Adv08_Hiro013| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:离开前，我装作漫不经心的样子，<br>扫了一眼整个淋浴房。|#0202Adv08_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCamera Offset:-5 Zoom:0.3 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（那个垃圾滑槽……<br>　能不能利用呢）|#0202Adv08_Hiro014|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCamera Offset:0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我一边这么思考着，<br>一边走出淋浴房。|#0202Adv08_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

